<title>FINLAND: NOKIA SAYS H1 DUE AUG 4 AT 1300 GMT.</title>
<headline>NOKIA SAYS H1 DUE AUG 4 AT 1300 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish telecommunications group Nokia Oy said in a statement on Tuesday it would release its January-June financial results on Monday, August 4, at about 1600/1300 GMT.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
